<node id="claim_4">
  <data key="d17">ObservationClaim</data>
  <data key="d18">Electrochemical reconstruction of chalcogenide-treated Co foam affords a highly enlarged active surface together with excellent catalytic activity and stability in a large-scale water electrolyzer.</data>
